# Upstream safety
- Treat gwdevhub/GWToolboxpp as upstream.
- Keep tracker changes isolated and rebase-friendly.
- Minimize existing-file modifications; no mass formatting or unrelated renames.
- Do not update dependencies without approval.
- Prefer new window/module/service/helper files.
- Justify every upstream file touched.
- Do not commit generated build output.
- Fork-specific functionality is acceptable.
